00:12:57.200 --> 00:13:01.520
finally fixed the product.
But here's the bigger problem.&nbsp;

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:07.120
Steve didn't just get unlucky&nbsp;
— these are routine for ASUS.&nbsp;

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:12.800
Someone shared that a repair quote for an RTX&nbsp;
