00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:29.520
In just one week, GamersNexus's video passed 1.5&nbsp;
million views. To date, it's over 2.3 million.&nbsp;

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:41.120
Asus's fraud was blown right open,&nbsp;
and everyone's eyes were on them.&nbsp;

